       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TF-GRAND-MASTER-SYNTHESIS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TF-GRAND-SYNTHESIS-PROOFS.
           05  WS-THEOREMS-1-TO-45-PASSED  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MULTI-TIER-ZORSE-SEALED  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLEAN-ROOM-PURITY-MET    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SUB-US-LATENCY-MET       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-50TH-THEOREM-JUBILEE-MET PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-GRAND-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-FULL-50-THEOREMS-PROVEN  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-GRAND-TF-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CUMULATIVE-PROOFS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-PERFORMANCE-AND-PURITY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-GRAND-JUBILEE.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CUMULATIVE-PROOFS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-THEOREMS-1-TO-45-PASSED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MULTI-TIER-ZORSE-SEALED.
       2000-EVALUATE-PERFORMANCE-AND-PURITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CLEAN-ROOM-PURITY-MET.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SUB-US-LATENCY-MET.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-GRAND-JUBILEE.
           IF WS-THEOREMS-1-TO-45-PASSED = 1 AND
              WS-MULTI-TIER-ZORSE-SEALED = 1 AND
              WS-CLEAN-ROOM-PURITY-MET = 1 AND
              WS-SUB-US-LATENCY-MET = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-50TH-THEOREM-JUBILEE-MET
               MOVE 1 TO WS-FULL-50-THEOREMS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-GRAND-TF-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-FULL-50-THEOREMS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-GRAND-TF-CODE.
